  "description": "All Lucia wants is a family. But as an illegitimate child of the House of Lordvel, she is cast into the Abyss. There she meets the Evil God and makes a pact to take revenge on the Lordvels. Reborn 10 years in the past, will Lucia rewrite her fate in this second life or succumb to dark forces beyond her control?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
